.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
*.log
.DS_Store

# apps/admin and apps/api are deliberately NOT excluded here any more: both ship as their
# own deployed images. "Local-only" no longer describes them - it describes *what they are
# never bundled into*, and that is each Dockerfile's per-member COPY list, not this file.
# .dockerignore is shared by every build, so a rule here silently removes a member from
# images it belongs in; excluding apps/api is why this file had to change at all.

# Docker meta
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore
